---
// ELK Stack Distributed Log Management Architecture Diagram
---

<figure class="elk-diagram" aria-labelledby="elk-caption">
  <svg
    class="elk-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="elk-title elk-desc"
  >
    <title id="elk-title">ELK Stack 分散式日誌管線與檢索架構</title>
    <desc id="elk-desc">
      展示從邊緣 Filebeat 採集、Kafka 削峰緩衝、Logstash 結構化解析，到
      Elasticsearch 倒排索引分片儲存、Kibana 視覺化與 Loki 架構演進。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="elk-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="elk-diagram__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Column 1: Ingestion & Buffering -->
    <g class="elk-diagram__card" transform="translate(25, 40)">
      <rect width="215" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="elk-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26"
        >COLLECTION &amp; INGESTION</text
      >
      <text class="elk-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">邊緣採集與削峰緩衝</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="elk-diagram__subcard elk-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text
          class="elk-diagram__header elk-diagram__header--teal"
          x="10"
          y="20">Filebeat (Go Agent)</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 部署於 Pod / 宿主機邊緣</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• 極低 CPU / 記憶體開銷</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• 內建背壓控制 (Backpressure)</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 170)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="80"
          rx="6"
          class="elk-diagram__subcard elk-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text
          class="elk-diagram__header elk-diagram__header--gold"
          x="10"
          y="20">Kafka / Redis 緩衝池</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• 流量尖峰削峰填谷</text>
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 防止 ES 寫入隊列打滿拒絕</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 260)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="elk-diagram__subcard elk-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text
          class="elk-diagram__header elk-diagram__header--blue"
          x="10"
          y="20">Logstash / Vector</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• Grok 正則過濾與結構化</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• GeoIP、脫敏與富化處理</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 2: Elasticsearch Core -->
    <g class="elk-diagram__card" transform="translate(255, 40)">
      <rect width="215" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="elk-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26"
        >INDEXING &amp; STORAGE</text
      >
      <text class="elk-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">Elasticsearch 核心</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="elk-diagram__subcard elk-diagram__subcard--purple"></rect>
        <text
          class="elk-diagram__header elk-diagram__header--purple"
          x="10"
          y="20">Lucene 倒排索引 (FST)</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• Term Dictionary ➔ Postings</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 記憶體 FST 有限狀態轉換機</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="78"
          >• 毫秒級關鍵字全文定位</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 170)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="80"
          rx="6"
          class="elk-diagram__subcard elk-diagram__subcard--orange"></rect>
        <text
          class="elk-diagram__header elk-diagram__header--orange"
          x="10"
          y="20">Doc Values 列式儲存</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• 正排索引磁碟映射</text>
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 高效排序、聚合與過濾</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 260)">
        <rect width="187" height="85" rx="6" class="elk-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="elk-diagram__header" x="10" y="20">分片與高可用架構</text>
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• Primary + Replica Shards</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 冷熱數據階層生命週期 (ILM)</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 3: Kibana Visualization -->
    <g class="elk-diagram__card" transform="translate(485, 40)">
      <rect width="215" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="elk-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26"
        >VISUALIZATION &amp; ALERTS</text
      >
      <text class="elk-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">Kibana 探勘與監控</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="elk-diagram__subcard elk-diagram__subcard--cyan"></rect>
        <text
          class="elk-diagram__header elk-diagram__header--cyan"
          x="10"
          y="20">Discover 即時探勘</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• KQL / Lucene 語法查詢</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 關聯 TraceID 秒級排障</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="78"
          >• 實時日誌尾隨 (Tail Logs)</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 170)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="80"
          rx="6"
          class="elk-diagram__subcard elk-diagram__subcard--green"></rect>
        <text
          class="elk-diagram__header elk-diagram__header--green"
          x="10"
          y="20">Dashboard 業務看板</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• 5xx 錯誤率熱力圖</text>
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• QPS 與請求延遲分位數</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 260)">
        <rect width="187" height="85" rx="6" class="elk-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="elk-diagram__header" x="10" y="20"
          >動態告警 (Alerting)</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• 閾值告警與異常檢測</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 串接 Slack / PagerDuty / Webhook</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 4: Modern Alternatives -->
    <g class="elk-diagram__card" transform="translate(715, 40)">
      <rect width="220" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="elk-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">MODERN EVOLUTION</text>
      <text class="elk-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">現代替代與成本演進</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="192"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="elk-diagram__subcard elk-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text
          class="elk-diagram__header elk-diagram__header--gold"
          x="10"
          y="20">Grafana Loki</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 僅索引標籤 Label (不索引內容)</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• Chunk 壓縮直寫 S3 物件儲存</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="78">• 儲存成本暴降 80%！</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 170)">
        <rect
          width="192"
          height="80"
          rx="6"
          class="elk-diagram__subcard elk-diagram__subcard--purple"></rect>
        <text
          class="elk-diagram__header elk-diagram__header--purple"
          x="10"
          y="20">OpenSearch</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• AWS 主導的 Apache 2.0 分叉</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 完全開源、無 SSPL 授權風險</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 260)">
        <rect width="192" height="85" rx="6" class="elk-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="elk-diagram__header" x="10" y="20"
          >Vector (Rust 採集器)</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 極致記憶體安全與吞吐</text
        >
        <text class="elk-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 全面取代重型 Logstash JVM</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Connecting Lines -->
    <path
      d="M 240 220 L 255 220"
      class="elk-diagram__flow-line"
      marker-end="url(#elk-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 470 220 L 485 220"
      class="elk-diagram__flow-line"
      marker-end="url(#elk-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 700 220 L 715 220"
      class="elk-diagram__flow-line"
      marker-end="url(#elk-arrow)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View -->
  <div class="elk-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="elk-mobile-card elk-mobile-card--teal">
      <span class="elk-mobile-badge elk-mobile-badge--teal"
        >1. COLLECTION &amp; BUFFER</span
      >
      <h4>邊緣採集與削峰 (Filebeat + Kafka)</h4>
      <p>
        Filebeat 輕量採集日誌，Kafka 削峰避免流量打滿，Logstash / Vector 進行
        Grok 結構化解析。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="elk-mobile-arrow">↓ 索引與分散式儲存</div>

    <div class="elk-mobile-card elk-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="elk-mobile-badge elk-mobile-badge--purple"
        >2. ELASTICSEARCH CORE</span
      >
      <h4>倒排索引 (FST) 與 Doc Values</h4>
      <p>
        Lucene 倒排索引實現毫秒級全文檢索，Doc Values
        列存加速彙總統計，分片保證水平擴展。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="elk-mobile-arrow">↓ 視覺化與排障</div>

    <div class="elk-mobile-card elk-mobile-card--cyan">
      <span class="elk-mobile-badge elk-mobile-badge--cyan"
        >3. KIBANA &amp; DASHBOARDS</span
      >
      <h4>即時探勘與動態告警</h4>
      <p>
        Discover 依據 TraceID 精準定位問題，視覺化 Dashboard 監控系統健康度與
        5xx 錯誤率。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="elk-mobile-arrow">↓ 現代技術演進</div>

    <div class="elk-mobile-card elk-mobile-card--gold">
      <span class="elk-mobile-badge elk-mobile-badge--gold"
        >4. LOKI &amp; OPENSEARCH</span
      >
      <h4>成本優化與開源替代</h4>
      <p>
        Grafana Loki 僅索引標籤將日誌壓縮直寫 S3（成本降 80%），OpenSearch
        提供無版權風險的開源選擇。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="elk-caption" class="elk-diagram__caption">
    圖 1：ELK Stack 分散式日誌管線、Elasticsearch 核心索引與現代日誌架構演進
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .elk-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .elk-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .elk-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .elk-diagram__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .elk-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .elk-diagram__card rect {
    fill: #0f172a;
    stroke: #1e293b;
  }

  .elk-diagram__badge {
    font-family:
      ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .elk-diagram__badge {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .elk-diagram__title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .elk-diagram__title {
    fill: #f8fafc;
  }

  .elk-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #ffffff;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .elk-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #1e293b;
    stroke: #334155;
  }

  .elk-diagram__subcard--teal {
    stroke: #14b8a6;
    fill: #f0fdfa;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .elk-diagram__subcard--teal {
    stroke: #0d9488;
    fill: #042f2e;
  }

  .elk-diagram__subcard--gold {
    stroke: #fbbf24;
    fill: #fefce8;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .elk-diagram__subcard--gold {
    stroke: #d97706;
    fill: #451a03;
  }

  .elk-diagram__subcard--blue {
    stroke: #38bdf8;
    fill: #f0f9ff;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .elk-diagram__subcard--blue {
    stroke: #0284c7;
    fill: #0c4a6e;
  }

  .elk-diagram__subcard--purple {
    stroke: #c084fc;
    fill: #faf5ff;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .elk-diagram__subcard--purple {
